-- Gl. (3) — Prozessrate (Monod), §4.5.1
update public.equations set verification_quote='Die formelmäßige Beschreibung der Monod-Funktion und damit die Basis der Berechnung von Wachs-tums- und Umsatzraten ist in Gleichung (3) dargestellt: | v=\mu_{\max } \cdot \frac{S_{x}}{k_{S, x}+S_{x}} \cdot \frac{k_{H, y}}{k_{H, y}+S_{y}} \cdot \theta^{\left(T-T_{0}\right)} \cdot X\left[\frac{g}{m^{3} \cdot d}\right] \tag{3} — printed p.18', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§4.5.1, printed p.18) [VC] — quote backfill only, status untouched. Dimensional check: 1/d x [-] x [-] x [-] x g/m3 = g/(m3·d), closes iff X is in g/m3. UNIT FINDING: the encoding feeds this Monod term the M349-02 field S_x (unit g/l) against k_S_x (mg/l) — a factor-1000 mismatch; §3.2 declares S_x as g/m3 (= mg/l). Staged.', verified_at=now() where id='940d75b9-a1a6-4c81-88ea-591b2381df8e' and verification_quote is null;

-- Gl. (4) — maximales Austauschvolumenverhältnis SBR, §5.4.1
update public.equations set verification_quote='Bei konventioneller SBR-Beschickung am Anfang des Batchzyklus wird das maximale Austauschvolumen durch die $\mathrm{NH}_{3}$-Hemmung begrenzt: | \Delta V_{\text {Batch,max }}=\frac{V_{\text {Austausch,max }}}{V_{\text {Reaktor }}}=\frac{C_{\mathrm{NH} 4, \max }-C_{\mathrm{NH} 4, \mathrm{AB}}}{C_{\mathrm{NH} 4, \mathrm{ZU}}} \tag{4} — printed p.30–32', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§5.4.1, printed p.30–32) [VC] — quote backfill only, status untouched. Dimensional check: (mg/l − mg/l)/(mg/l) = dimensionless, matches the printed unit (m3/m3). The encoding drops the middle member V_Austausch,max/V_Reaktor and keeps the right-hand member — equivalent.', verified_at=now() where id='c6590142-7b2f-4b30-bb01-6ec303ba37d3' and verification_quote is null;

-- Gl. (5) — Volumen einer Teilbeschickung, §5.4.1
update public.equations set verification_quote='V_{\text {Teil }}=\frac{\Delta C_{\mathrm{NH} 4}}{C_{\mathrm{NH} 4, \mathrm{ZU}}} \cdot V_{\text {Reaktor }} \tag{5} | $V_{\text {Teil }} \quad\left(\mathrm{m}^{3}\right)$ das Volumen einer Teilbeschickung (Aliquot) und — printed p.30–32', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§5.4.1, printed p.30–32) [VC] — quote backfill only, status untouched. Dimensional check: (mg/l)/(mg/l) x m3 = m3, consistent.', verified_at=now() where id='6acd179f-cbf2-48c5-8067-857d46555452' and verification_quote is null;

-- Gl. (6) — Schlammwasseranfall, §6.2.2
update public.equations set verification_quote='Q_{\mathrm{SW}}=Q_{\mathrm{Dus}} \cdot\left(1-\frac{T R_{\mathrm{Dus}}}{T R_{\mathrm{DS}}}\right)+Q_{\mathrm{Kond}}\left(\mathrm{~m}^{3} / \mathrm{h}\right) \tag{6} — printed p.38–39', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.2, printed p.38–39) [VC] — quote backfill only, status untouched. Dimensional check: m3/h x (1 − ratio) + m3/h = m3/h, consistent; TR_Düs/TR_DS is a ratio so the % encoding is safe here.', verified_at=now() where id='7db3ffdf-b739-4e62-8ec5-88c53a1237fe' and verification_quote is null;

-- Gl. (7) — Rückbelastung des Nährstoffs x, §6.2.2
update public.equations set verification_quote='B_{\mathrm{d}, \mathrm{x}, \mathrm{R} \ddot{\mathrm{u} c k}}=\left(\eta_{\mathrm{oTSPS}} \cdot B_{\mathrm{d}, \mathrm{PS}} \cdot G V_{\mathrm{PS}} \cdot i_{\mathrm{x}, \mathrm{PS}}+\eta_{\mathrm{oTS}, \mathrm{ÜS}} \cdot B_{\mathrm{d}, \mathrm{ÜS}} \cdot G V_{\ddot{\mathrm{U}} \mathrm{~S}} \cdot i_{\mathrm{x}, \mathrm{ÜS}}\right)(\mathrm{kg} / \mathrm{d}) \text { bzw. }(\mathrm{g} /(\mathrm{E} \cdot \mathrm{~d})) \tag{7} — printed p.39', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.2, printed p.38–39) [VC] — quote backfill only, status untouched. Dimensional check: eta [%] x kg/d x GV [%] x i [kg/kg] gives kg/d ONLY if eta and GV are used as fractions; the guideline prints both in % and states no /100 conversion — engine-side scaling finding, staged. Note the printed formula writes eta_oTS,PS while the nomenclature and §3.2 write eta_oTR,PS.', verified_at=now() where id='63a1ee70-7d98-4458-bd24-999d9d5a58a4' and verification_quote is null;

-- Gl. (8) — Konzentration des Nährstoffs x im Schlammwasser, §6.2.2
update public.equations set verification_quote='S_{\mathrm{x}}=\frac{B_{\mathrm{d}, \mathrm{x}, \text { Rück }}}{\frac{B_{\mathrm{d}, \mathrm{PS}}}{T R_{\mathrm{PS}}}+\frac{B_{\mathrm{d}, \mathrm{U}}}{T R_{\mathrm{U}}}}(\mathrm{~g} / \mathrm{l}) \tag{8} — printed p.39', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.2, printed p.39) [VC] — quote backfill only, status untouched. Dimensional check: (kg/d)/((kg/d)/(g/l)) = g/l, consistent ONLY when TR is taken in g/l (the nomenclature offers "(g/l) oder (%)"); the encoded TR_PS/TR_UES unit is % — staged.', verified_at=now() where id='e802b5f8-6cc6-4a18-a023-7dd2d87b3a29' and verification_quote is null;

-- Gl. (9) — Säurekapazität aus NH4-N, §6.2.2
update public.equations set verification_quote='K_{\mathrm{S} 4,3}=S_{\mathrm{NH} 4-\mathrm{N}} / 14 \quad(\mathrm{mmol} / \mathrm{l}) \tag{9} | 14 & $(\mathrm{~g} / \mathrm{mol})$ bzw. $(\mathrm{mg} / \mathrm{mmol})$ & Stickstoffmolmasse — printed p.39–40', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.2, printed p.39–40) [VC] — quote backfill only, status untouched. Dimensional check: (mg/l)/(mg/mmol) = mmol/l, consistent.', verified_at=now() where id='111ba0f4-d907-449c-addd-11150169e75b' and verification_quote is null;

-- Gl. (10) — Sauerstoffbedarf Nitrifikation/Denitrifikation, §6.4.4
update public.equations set verification_quote='\left.O V_{\mathrm{d}} \approx f_{\mathrm{end}} \cdot O V_{\mathrm{d}, \mathrm{~N}}=f_{\mathrm{end}} \cdot Q_{\mathrm{d}} \cdot 4,33 \cdot\left(S_{\mathrm{NH} 4, \mathrm{SWB}, \mathrm{ZU}}-S_{\mathrm{NH} 4, \mathrm{SWB}, \mathrm{AB}}\right) / 1.000 \quad(\mathrm{~kg} / \mathrm{d} \mathrm{O})^{4}\right)^{4} \tag{10} — printed p.45', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.4.4, printed p.45) [VC] — quote backfill only, status untouched. Dimensional check: [-] x m3/d x [mg O2/mg N] x mg/l / 1000 = kg O2/d, consistent. f_end = 1,3 for N/DN (same clause).', verified_at=now() where id='434180b4-5a42-4930-a25a-284904bf8c40' and verification_quote is null;

-- Gl. (11) — Sauerstoffbedarf Nitritation/Denitritation, §6.4.4
update public.equations set verification_quote='\left.O V_{\mathrm{d}} \approx f_{\mathrm{end}} \cdot O V_{\mathrm{d}, \mathrm{~N}}=f_{\mathrm{end}} \cdot Q_{\mathrm{d}} \cdot 3,24 \cdot\left(S_{\mathrm{NH} 4, \mathrm{SWB}, \mathrm{ZU}}-S_{\mathrm{NH} 4, \mathrm{SWB}, \mathrm{AB}}\right) / 1.000 \quad\left(\mathrm{~kg} / \mathrm{d} \mathrm{O}_{2}\right)^{5}\right) \tag{11} — printed p.45–46', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.4.4, printed p.45–46) [VC] — quote backfill only, status untouched. Dimensional check identical to Gl.10 and consistent. f_end = 1,0 (Ausschwemmreaktor) or 1,25 (sonst) — printed SR-2 alternatives, staged.', verified_at=now() where id='b0612d96-e446-4938-881f-0a0b3bf082c9' and verification_quote is null;

-- Gl. (12) — Sauerstoffbedarf Deammonifikation, §6.4.4
